<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>截图种子页（仅测试用）</title>
<style>
  html, body { margin: 0; height: 100%; background: #ffffff; }
  p { font: 16px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; color: #4a5a6a; padding: 1rem; }
</style>
